# Test sources are never compiled into the image: every package/app tsconfig
# builds `src/**` only and excludes `**/*.test.ts`, so nothing under these paths
# can reach `/out`. Excluding them keeps a test-only edit from invalidating the
# `COPY . .` layer and forcing a full ~8-minute rebuild — which is exactly what
# blows the 300s `beforeAll` hook timeout in
# packages/router/test/containers-real-docker.e2e.test.ts (that suite builds this
# image itself). Recorded as a gotcha by the 2026-07-17 router-mode drive.
packages/*/test
apps/*/test
**/*.test.ts

# ---- Terraform state and variables: LOAD-BEARING FOR SECRECY ----------------
# Do not prune these as "unused" or "just build speed". scripts/deploy-router-image.sh
# runs `az acr build … .`, which tars the whole working directory and UPLOADS it
# to the registry, honouring this file (azure-cli
# command_modules/acr/_archive_utils.py: _pack_source_code -> _load_dockerignore_file).
# Without these entries every deploy would ship, off this machine:
#   infra/azure/terraform/env/dev.tfvars    mode 600 — Linear client secret + both live OAuth tokens
#   infra/azure/terraform/terraform.tfstate mode 600 — Terraform writes `sensitive` values to state in PLAINTEXT
#   infra/azure/terraform/terraform.tfstate.backup
#   infra/azure/terraform/.terraform/       638 MB provider cache (also busts the `COPY . .` layer every run)
# None of it is needed by docker/router/Dockerfile, which builds only the pnpm
# workspace — pnpm-workspace.yaml is `packages/*` + `apps/*`, so infra/ is not a member.
#
# Both the bare and the `**/` form of each rule are required, and `.terraform`
# must NOT carry a trailing slash. ACR compiles `**/x` to `^.*/x$` (needs at
# least one separator, so it misses a root-level file), `*.x` to `^[^/]*\.x$`
# (misses a nested one), and a trailing `/` to a pattern ending in `/$`, which
# no archive entry can ever match. Verified against the installed
# _archive_utils.IgnoreRule, not assumed.
.terraform
**/.terraform
*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars
*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfstate.*
tfplan
**/tfplan
# Residue of a SIGKILL'd rewrite in scripts/deploy-router-image.sh — a mode-600
# copy of dev.tfvars, so it must never be uploaded either.
*.tfvars.tmp.*
**/*.tfvars.tmp.*
